{"version":1,"content":"<p>維基百科運營方維基媒體基金會在一宗涉及《紐約時報》、OpenAI和微軟等公司的AI版權訴訟中提交法庭之友意見書，主張法院不要把人工智能訓練和聊天機械人向用户復現內容混為一談。基金會沒有支持任何一方的整體立場，而是警告，過於簡單化的裁決可能同時傷害開放知識與互聯網內容生態。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1584454.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T09:23:54.780658+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":141,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T09:15:15+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T09:18:58.779508+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T09:18:58.779508+00:00","content_hash":"1e6cdf12ee030751c0d4416a1c5d751b96f971291527e8da31eb45e3ac857a36","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}